==English==
{{rfc|en|the definitions are '''all over the place'''; I don't see any meaningful difference in the definitions or usexes of adjectives, adverbs and prepositional phrases}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|all over the board}}
* {{l|en|all over the shop}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|head=[[all over]] the [[place]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} [[inconsistent|Inconsistent]]; lacking a clear [[pattern]]; with a large amount of [[variation]].
#: ''I asked each person in turn, and their answers were '''all over the place'''.''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|random}}
* {{l|en|scattershot}}

